# 小屏, a finger, on `home`'s chats: Home made again while measured, its list a screenful of rows made in one frame
# (the first screen is made before `log measure`, as Tester::new's first frame; `home`'s scrolls make few rows): the
# bottom bar to 文件 and back to 会话 (Home made anew as it comes back), the workspace switched to 个人 (none of these
# chats there) and back to 星火工作室 (its rows made anew), the filter to 我参与的 and back to 全部会话 (another list
# each time). What a phone's hangs at the bar's and the workspace's switch are (`ui_hang`: ~1,000 made, ~1,300 laid).
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
until 今天
wait 500
log measure
tap icon:folder
until =文件
wait 900
tap icon:chats
until 整理发布清单
wait 900
tap1 星火工作室
wait 700
tap 个人
gone 整理发布清单
wait 900
tap1 个人
wait 700
tap 星火工作室
until 整理发布清单
wait 900
tap icon:filter
until 我参与的
tap 我参与的
wait 900
tap icon:filter
until 全部会话
tap 全部会话
wait 900
exit
